### ==============================================
### CANCEL PENDING BOOKING API TESTS
### ==============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@bookingCode = BK001234
@accessToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### ==============================================
### 1. Cancel Pending Booking - Success Case
### ==============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingCode}}/cancel-pending
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ==============================================
### 2. Cancel Pending Booking - Booking Not Found
### ==============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/INVALID_CODE/cancel-pending
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ==============================================
### 3. Cancel Pending Booking - Already Cancelled
### (Test với booking đã bị cancel trước đó)
### ==============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/BK_ALREADY_CANCELLED/cancel-pending
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ==============================================
### 4. Cancel Pending Booking - Already Paid
### (Test với booking đã thanh toán thành công)
### ==============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/BK_ALREADY_PAID/cancel-pending
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ==============================================
### 5. Cancel Pending Booking - Unauthorized
### (Test không có token)
### ==============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingCode}}/cancel-pending
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ==============================================
### 6. Full Flow Test: Create → Cancel
### ==============================================

# Step 1: Create a booking first
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tripId": 1,
  "seatNumber": "A1,A2",
  "totalAmount": 200000,
  "guestFullName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "guestPhone": "0901234567",
  "guestEmail": "test@example.com",
  "guestAddress": "123 Test Street"
}

###

# Step 2: Get the booking code from response above and cancel it
# Replace {{newBookingCode}} with actual code from step 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{newBookingCode}}/cancel-pending
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

# Step 3: Verify booking was cancelled - Get booking detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{newBookingCode}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

# Step 4: Check seat status - Should be available again
GET {{baseUrl}}/trips/1/seats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### ==============================================
### NOTES FOR TESTING:
### ==============================================
# 1. Replace {{accessToken}} with a valid JWT token
# 2. Replace {{bookingCode}} with an actual booking code from your system
# 3. For full flow test:
#    - Run Step 1 to create booking
#    - Copy bookingCode from response
#    - Paste into Step 2 and run
#    - Verify with Step 3 and 4
#
# Expected Results:
# - Success: HTTP 200, booking cancelled, seats released
# - Not Found: HTTP 404
# - Forbidden: HTTP 403
# - Bad Request: HTTP 400 (already paid/cancelled)
###
